[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_euwsw"]
script = ExtResource("5_jputc")
markedup_text = "Clear all stalls from the banks."
outcome = SubResource("Resource_aberr")
markedup_result_text = "The warden remains unconvinced and orders the stalls moved away.

\"The risk is too great to ignore,\" he insists.

Reluctantly, the settlers help the stall keepers pack up their bowls and carts, and the crowd soon disperses, grumbling about the heat."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_pf0v3"]
script = ExtResource("3_lbnye")
markedup_text = "The reservoir was built to hold back disaster, but it has grown to serve as a place of leisure instead.

Stalls line the banks, selling juicy dumplings and cold barley tea. The air is filled with the rustle of leaves and relaxed chatter.

A safety warden frowns at the crowd, tapping his ledger. \"If a fire starts, these benches will block the bucket brigade. This is a hazard, not a park.\"

\"If a fire starts, we'll douse it with tea!\" the keeper laughs. \"Come, sit!\""
